  <!-- EN: Ancient Ruination Glare -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.label>远古湮灭眩光</GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.label>
  <!-- EN: High-intensity, medium-range firepower will let our titans break enemy lines far more easily. These ancient cannons were once the foundation of a stellar empire. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.description>高强度中射程火力将会让我们的泰坦舰更加轻易地突破敌人的战线。这些远古的火炮曾是一个星海帝国建立的根基。</GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.description>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.tools.barrel.label>枪管</GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Ancient Ruination Glare -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.verbs.Verb_GrayTitanLance.label>远古湮灭眩光</GR_MechWeapon_AncientTitanLance.verbs.Verb_GrayTitanLance.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Arc Emitter -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.label>电弧发射器</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.label>
  <!-- EN: Fires an arc of chaotic energy at the target—a powerful weapon that ignores armor and shields. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.description>向目标发射混乱能量的电弧，可以无视装甲和护盾的强大武器。</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.description>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.tools.barrel.label>枪管</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Arc Emitter -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>电弧发射器</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmitters.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Concentrated Arc Emitter -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.label>聚能电弧发射器</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.label>
  <!-- EN: These upgraded emitters are equipped with superior focusing lenses, allowing them to discharge even greater energy. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.description>这些升级后的发射器装备了更优秀的聚焦透镜，这使得它们可以发射出更加强大的能量。</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.description>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.tools.barrel.label>枪管</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Concentrated Arc Emitter -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>聚能电弧发射器</GR_MechWeapon_ArcEmittersPlus.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Particle Lance -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances.label>粒子光矛</GR_MechWeapon_Lances.label>
  <!-- EN: These heavy energy weapons fire focused particle beams and deal enormous damage. The size of their emitter arrays limits them to battleships and titans. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances.description>这些重型能量武器能够发射聚焦的粒子射线并造成巨幅伤害。发射阵列的规模限制了它们只能运用在战列舰和泰坦上。</GR_MechWeapon_Lances.description>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances.tools.barrel.label>枪管</GR_MechWeapon_Lances.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Particle Lance -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>粒子光矛</GR_MechWeapon_Lances.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Tachyon Lance -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.label>快子光矛</GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.label>
  <!-- EN: A more powerful version of the particle lance, firing a tachyon beam that carries immense energy. Like its predecessor, it can only be mounted on battleships and titans. -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.description>粒子光矛更为强力的版本，该武器发射携带有巨大能量的快子光束。和它的之前版本一样，只能运用在战列舰和泰坦上。</GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.description>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.tools.barrel.label>枪管</GR_MechWeapon_Lances_Plus.tools.barrel.label>
